    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface underway data collected from R/V Nathaniel B. Palmer in the Pacific Ocean, South Atlantic Ocean and Southern Ocean from 2020-01-28 to 2020-12-11. These data include barometric pressure, partial pressure carbon dioxide (pCO2) - water, sea surface salinity, sea surface temperature and barometric pressure. The instruments used to collect these data include Carbon dioxide (CO2) gas analyzer and shower head chamber equilibrator for autonomous carbon dioxide (CO2) measurement.",
